#: ../../src/index.rst:3
msgid "Welcome to the libuv documentation"
msgstr "欢迎阅读 libuv 文档"

#: ../../src/index.rst:6
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../src/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"libuv is a multi-platform support library with a focus on asynchronous "
"I/O. It was primarily developed for use by `Node.js`_, but it's also used"
" by `Luvit`_, `Julia`_, `uvloop`_, and `others`_."
msgstr "libuv 是一个专注于异步 I/O 的多平台支持库。它最初主要为 `Node.js`_ 编写，但 `Luvit`_、`Julia`_、`uvloop`_ 以及 `others`_ 也在使用它。"

#: ../../src/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"In case you find errors in this documentation you can help by sending "
"`pull requests <https://github.com/libuv/libuv>`_!"
msgstr "如果你发现本文档中有错误，可以通过提交 `拉取请求 <https://github.com/libuv/libuv>`_ 来提供帮助！"

#: ../../src/index.rst:24
msgid "Features"
msgstr "特性"

#: ../../src/index.rst:26
msgid "Full-featured event loop backed by epoll, kqueue, IOCP, event ports."
msgstr "功能完备的事件循环，由 epoll、kqueue、IOCP、event ports 支撑。"

#: ../../src/index.rst:27
msgid "Asynchronous TCP and UDP sockets"
msgstr "异步 TCP 和 UDP 套接字"

#: ../../src/index.rst:28
msgid "Asynchronous DNS resolution"
msgstr "异步 DNS 解析"

#: ../../src/index.rst:29
msgid "Asynchronous file and file system operations"
msgstr "异步文件和文件系统操作"

#: ../../src/index.rst:30
msgid "File system events"
msgstr "文件系统事件"

#: ../../src/index.rst:31
msgid "ANSI escape code controlled TTY"
msgstr "由 ANSI 转义码控制的 TTY"

#: ../../src/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"IPC with socket sharing, using Unix domain sockets or named pipes "
"(Windows)"
msgstr "支持套接字共享的 IPC，使用 Unix 域套接字或命名管道（Windows）"

#: ../../src/index.rst:33
msgid "Child processes"
msgstr "子进程"

#: ../../src/index.rst:34
msgid "Thread pool"
msgstr "线程池"

#: ../../src/index.rst:35
msgid "Signal handling"
msgstr "信号处理"

#: ../../src/index.rst:36
msgid "High resolution clock"
msgstr "高分辨率时钟"

#: ../../src/index.rst:37
msgid "Threading and synchronization primitives"
msgstr "线程与同步原语"

#: ../../src/index.rst:41
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档"

#: ../../src/index.rst:53
msgid "Downloads"
msgstr "下载"

#: ../../src/index.rst:55
msgid "libuv can be downloaded from `here <https://dist.libuv.org/dist/>`_."
msgstr "libuv 可以从 `此处 <https://dist.libuv.org/dist/>`_ 下载。"

#: ../../src/index.rst:59
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../src/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"Installation instructions can be found in the `README "
"<https://github.com/libuv/libuv/blob/master/README.md>`_."
msgstr "安装说明可在 `README <https://github.com/libuv/libuv/blob/master/README.md>`_ 中找到。"

